// corpus: known-failure materializing a comprehension of 9801 elements exceeds the 1024-turn iteration limit (ROADMAP: "Default iteration limit of 1024 for Epsil programs")
// Project Euler 29: distinct values of a^b for 2 <= a, b <= 100.
length(unique([a^b for a in 2..100, b in 2..100]))
// ➔ 9183
